.DS_Store

# dist/src is committed on purpose. `/plugin install` clones this repo and runs the hook
# straight out of it - there is no build step and no npm install in that path. There are no
# runtime dependencies, so the compiled output is the whole shipping artifact.
#
# The negation is load-bearing: the parent repository ignores `dist/` at any depth, and git
# will not re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the directory has to be
# un-excluded before anything inside it can be added.
!dist/
dist/test/
